description: Every table/column change must update migration, schema snapshot and Model
alwaysApply: true
---

# Schema + Model Sync Rule

On any new table or column change, update all three in the same change:
1. Migration in `app/Database/Migrations` (guard with `tableExists`/`fieldExists`; master tables go in `TenantEnsureMaster`).
2. `app/Database/Schema/tables.php` (regenerate with `php spark schema:snapshot -tenant <key>`).
3. The Model in `app/Models` (`$allowedFields`, casts, validation; new table = new Model).
